{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, grab and check object, move to it, do specific task; scan area if necessary. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInFront    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
